图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin that validates and ranks 3/5 independent coding-agent patches before approval-gated apply.","id":"gh:1340236138","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-llm-verifier","slug":"Web0926/dsh-llm-verifier","topics":["agent-evaluation","ai-agents","coding-agent","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh-plugin","git-worktree","llm-as-a-verifier","llm-as-judge","patch-verification","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin that validates and ranks 3/5 independent coding-agent patches before approva"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ss plugin that validates and ranks 3/5 independent coding-agent patches before approval-gated apply."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-llm-verifier"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Generate several coding-agent patches, reject the ones that fail your tests, and let an LLM verifier"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" rank the rest before you decide whether to apply the winner."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"`dsh-llm-verifier` is a developer-preview plugin for DeepSeek Harness. It runs **3 or 5 independent "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"coding candidates** in detached Git worktrees, validates every candidate against project tests, rank"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"s the passing patches with `llm-verifier`, and keeps the original checkout unchanged until a separat"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"e approval applies the selected patch."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> [!WARNING]\n> This public version is for **trusted repositories only**. Candidate generation uses d"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"etached Git worktrees and the DeepSeek Harness `workspace-write` permission mode, but validation com"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"mands still execute code from the target repository on the host. Read the security boundaries before"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"l execute code from the target repository on the host. Read the security boundaries before using it."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Why this exists"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"A single coding-agent run can produce a plausible patch, yet another independent run may find a simp"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ler fix, add better tests, or avoid a subtle regression. Running several candidates manually creates"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" a new problem: comparing them consistently."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"This plugin turns that process into one approval-gated workflow:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"1. Give every candidate the same coding task.\n2. Keep candidate edits in separate detached worktrees"},{"id":"p10s2","text":".\n3. Run deterministic project validation before model-based ranking.\n4. Exclude candidates that fai"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"l validation.\n5. Rank the remaining patches with an LLM verifier when comparison is needed.\n6. Produ"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ce an auditable report and winner patch.\n7. Apply the winner only after a second explicit approval, "},{"id":"p10s5","text":"then rerun validation."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **Best-of-3 or Best-of-5:** use 3 candidates by default, or 5 for higher-value tasks.\n- **Validati"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"on-first selection:** failing candidates never enter model ranking.\n- **Efficient ranking:** one pas"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"sing candidate wins by validation; two use one pivot; three to five use two pivots.\n- **Two approval"},{"id":"p13s4","text":" gates:** one before candidate execution and another before applying the winner.\n- **Integrity check"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"s before apply:** repository path, base `HEAD`, clean state, and winner-patch SHA-256 are checked ag"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"ain.\n- **Auditable artifacts:** reports include rankings, changed files, timings, process status, pa"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"tch hashes, verifier requests, and token usage.\n- **Credential controls:** validation processes do n"},{"id":"p13s8","text":"ot receive the DeepSeek API key; logs, errors, validation output, and text diffs are redacted agains"},{"id":"p13s9","text":"t the exact credential value.\n- **No automatic Git mutation:** the plugin does not commit, push, sta"},{"id":"p13s10","text":"sh, reset, or automatically apply a patch."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Current status"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Item | Current public version |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Release stage | Developer preview |\n| DeepSeek Harness | Pinned to `0.1.0-rc.7` |\n| Node.js | `24."},{"id":"p16s2","text":"x` |\n| Python bridge | Managed by `uv`; Python `>=3.9,<3.14` |\n| `llm-verifier` | Pinned to `0.2.0` "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"|\n| Platforms | macOS and Linux |\n| Candidate counts | `3` or `5`; default `3` |\n| Distribution | Lo"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"cal-path installation after building from source |\n| License | MIT |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Install or prepare:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.7`\n- Node.js 24 and pnpm `11.7.0`\n- `uv`\n- Git\n- A DeepSeek credential "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"available to Harness through the credential reference `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### 1. Clone, install, and verify"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### 2. Add the local plugin to the Web profile"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### 3. Start Harness in a clean target repository"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Ask Harness to use the tool, for example:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Equivalent tool input:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The tool returns the run ID, status, eligible candidates, ranking, report path, token usage, and—whe"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"n a winner exists—the local path to `winner.patch`."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"After reviewing the report and patch, explicitly call:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"through `apply_verified_winner`. The plugin requests a separate approval before applying the patch a"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"nd reruns the original validation commands afterward."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### 4. Remove the plugin"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"### `verified_best_of`"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Runs candidate generation, validation, and winner selection without modifying the original checkout."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Parameter | Required | Description |\n|---|---:|---|\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Security boundaries"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"The plugin is deliberately conservative about repository mutation, credentials, and artifacts, but t"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"he current public version is **not a container boundary**."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"- It accepts only a normal, clean Git repository root.\n- It rejects submodules, sparse checkouts, li"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"nked worktrees, and uncommitted changes.\n- Candidate edits live under `$DSH_HOME/llm-verifier/runs/<"},{"id":"p43s3","text":"runId>` in detached worktrees.\n- Candidate Harness processes use the explicit `workspace-write` perm"},{"id":"p43s4","text":"ission mode and do not inherit the host `DSH_PERMISSION_MODE`.\n- Validation commands execute reposit"},{"id":"p43s5","text":"ory code on the host. Use this version only with repositories and validation commands you trust.\n- V"},{"id":"p43s6","text":"alidation processes do not receive the API key.\n- If a candidate writes the exact credential into te"},{"id":"p43s7","text":"xt, binary content, or a symbolic-link target, that candidate is invalidated.\n- Binary data is never"},{"id":"p43s8","text":" sent to the verifier; complete binary patches remain local.\n- Cancellation and timeout handling ter"},{"id":"p43s9","text":"minate the candidate process group and attempt to clean up plugin-created worktrees.\n- An apply fail"},{"id":"p43s10","text":"ure is left in place for inspection; the plugin does not run `git reset` as an automatic rollback."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Review every approval prompt, especially the validation commands shown before execution."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## Current limitations"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"- No Windows support.\n- No dirty worktrees, submodules, sparse checkouts, or linked worktrees.\n- Can"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"didate count is fixed to 3 or 5.\n- No automatic commit, push, merge, or patch application.\n- No Open"},{"id":"p46s3","text":"AI, Vertex, vLLM, or other verifier backends.\n- No custom Web UI, ProgressTracker, or early stopping"},{"id":"p46s4","text":".\n- Source installation only; no npm package or prebuilt GitHub release yet."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
